{
 "about": "Every control of the Retro Studio (its markup, system/retro-panel.htm, which was /retro.html until the page moved into the room and which the Studio still mounts, and the controls system/retro-studio.js builds while it runs) against the shader room of The Playground. A control is mapped to the room control that does its job, with an act: how tests/retro-parity.cjs drives it and what must change. While missing has entries /retro.html stays; with it empty /retro.html redirects into the room.",
